WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
Hey guys, I'm Rob.

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.640
I make UGC videos for brands.

3
00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.840
That includes reviews, demos, unboxings,

4
00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.080
testimonials, and even ads.

5
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.160
It's your product with a real
person within a real home.

6
00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.640
Before working in UGC, I spent
nearly 20 years as a creative

7
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.280
within the television
and streaming industry.

8
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:24.480
My work's won PromaxBDA awards for TBS,

9
00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:26.660
TNT, and even HBO.

10
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:30.960
So I know what makes
people stop scrolling.

11
00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.640
Here are a few examples:

12
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:33.940
tree stands,

13
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.220
microphones,

14
00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.060
humidifiers,

15
00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:39.700
truck covers.

16
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.320
If you sell it, I can film it.

17
00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:44.020
Send me your product.

18
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.180
I'll film it in 4K,

19
00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.640
vertical or horizontal,

20
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.040
with a strong hook and clean edits

21
00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:54.320
that's going to be ready for
TikTok, Reels, or your ads.

22
00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.370
So go ahead and message me and
let's make something that people watch.
